{
  "name": "find_chain",
  "description": "BM25 search over all 374 AINumbers ChainGraph chains. Returns ranked chains with their full recipe: ordered node sequence, deep-links, composer URL, and entry tool mcp_name. Agent flow: find_chain(query) → read recipe → call the listed node MCP tools in order, passing parent_hashes between steps. Task-shaped queries work well: \"reserve composition recompute\", \"FR 2052a classification\", \"CCP margin replication\", \"SR 26-2 model validation benchmark\", \"litigation damages recompute\", \"evidence pack assembly\".",
